# Purpose and Method

This baseline applies the drawing-set methodology recorded in
`00_admin/reference_proposals/BFA_Drawing_Set_Methodology_INTERNAL.docx`,
following the construction procedure in
`00_admin/drawing_set_and_spec_baseline.SCHEMA.md`.

The method answers one question: how much drafting work is in this project, and
what forces each unit of it into existence. Two tables do two jobs:

| Table | Job |
|---|---|
| Sheet List | Enumerate the sheets — the deterministic part |
| Sheet Count by Discipline | Bound the estimate low / expected / high — the probabilistic part |

Every row of the sheet list carries a justification. Strip that column and the
table becomes a wish list; keep it and it is an estimating model defensible line
by line.

